      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I have experienced this before. It can't be reproduced on another avatar as it's limited to the local user and I don't know what brings the issue on in the first place to even comprehend how someone else can reproduce it. I have found a fix on my end though that resets this and it is by clearing the Local Profile data. It is the only fix I have found. clearing cache doesn't fix it but resetting the profile data will. I've had this happen twice in the last... two years? It appears randomly.",
